Package: VESimHouseholdsSJV
Type: Package
Title: Create Simulated Households with Attributes for VERSPM for San Joaquin Valley
Version: 3.1.2
Date: 2025-09-17
Author: Brian Gregor [aut, cre],
Maintainer: Nick Fisher <nicholas.fisher@rsginc.com>
Copyright: ODOT
Description: This package contains several modules which create synthetic
    households with attributes of persons by age group, income, workers,
    and life cycle. It also prepares a data frame of model estimation data from
    Census PUMS data that is used to estimate models in this package and the
    VELandUse package. This package is updated to reflect the specific PUMS for the SKATS MPO in Oregon and should work in the current framework for VisionEval.
License: file LICENSE
